{"duration_api_ms":91015,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5c949125-fd62-4f8e-9067-5027a1ac0685","total_cost_usd":0.6968518,"usage":{"input_tokens":24,"cache_creation_input_tokens":53762,"cache_read_input_tokens":495899,"output_tokens":8374,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1319},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":53762,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":782,"cache_read_input_tokens":55634,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4108,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4108},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":24,"outputTokens":8374,"cacheReadInputTokens":495899,"cacheCreationInputTokens":53762,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6968518,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1319,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01PMJAwRqGF4uRmEsQHfduVc","tool_input":{"command":"cat src/DcaShop.Product/Domain/glossary.md; ls -R src/DcaShop.Product | grep -v '^$' | head -100","description":"Read Product glossary and layout"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":16,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The plan for CAT-03 stops with a question for you. One of the four scenarios describes behaviour the shop doesn't have, so the story can't be adopted as written.\n\n**The mismatch:** scenario `not-found-page-has-the-shop-title` expects the not-found page's tab title to be \"domaincentric.commerce\". The shop shows \"Page Not Found\". The 404 view sets that title (`src/DcaShop.Web/Views/Error/404.cshtml:1`), and the layout uses the shop name only when a view sets no title (`src/DcaShop.Web/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml:9`).\n\n**The other three scenarios hold in the code:**\n- **404 message:** the \"404\" code, the \"Page Not Found\" heading and the message text are in `404.cshtml:3-6`.\n- **\"Browse All Products\":** the link goes to `/products`, which shows \"Our Products\".\n- **\"Go to Homepage\":** the link goes to `/`, which shows \"Welcome to domaincentric.commerce\".\n- **Routing:** `/products/no-such-product` never reaches the Product context. The route only accepts a GUID, so the request falls through to the web host's error page.\n\n**Test coverage:** only `ShopFlowTest.UnknownPageRendersThe404Page` touches this page. It uses a different address and checks just the status code and the \"404\" element.\n\n**Written:**\n- `tasks/CAT-03/plan.md`: all four scenarios with their keys and test levels (e2e for the happy path, integration for the rest). For each one it gives where the behaviour lives and which test covers it, or that none does. It ends in `## needs-human`.\n- `.agents/factory/decisions/CAT-03-01.md`, with three options:\n  1. Change the scenario to expect \"Page Not Found\".\n  2. Remove the title from the 404 view so the shop name shows. That changes behaviour, so the story would no longer be adoptable.\n  3. Drop the scenario and adopt the other three.\n\n**My recommendation:** check the Java sample's 404 page first, since the .NET views are meant to mirror it one to one. If Java shows the shop name, take option 2 as a by-hand fix. If it shows \"Page Not Found\", take option 1. I didn't read the Java template because it's outside this stage's inputs.\n\nNo other stage was run.","ttft_ms":3230,"type":"result","duration_ms":92129,"uuid":"1dc3fa21-42c2-4549-9b2c-b6a4037ab2c1","ttft_stream_ms":1931,"time_to_request_ms":60,"first_content_frame_ms":1931,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
